Meta.documentation:Number.equal
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Tells whether all Numbers in the flow are equal.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Chained comparison: emits true only if every Number equals every other.
Meta.documentation:Exact comparison of rationals — base doesn't matter (Number:1#2 equals
Meta.documentation:Number:1).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_default_$all — each Number to compare
Meta.documentation:@port out_Boolean_default — true if all inputs are equal, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:11#2 Number:3]>>Number.equal:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:true
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.less Number.greater
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
